 flexibility, documentation support, batch transparency, and sourcing coordination.\n\nHow {{brand_name}} can support:\n- MOQ flexibility support for early-stage or scaling programs\n- Documentation support for internal technical review\n- Batch transparency and qualified B2B supply communication\n\nIf this is relevant for {{company_name}}, we would be glad to discuss current priorities and next steps.\n\nReply to: {{reply_to_email}}\n\n{{default_signature}}',0,1,NOW(),NOW()),
(1,'Initial Outreach - Ingredient Distributors','Ingredient distributors','Peptide sourcing support for distribution teams at {{company_name}}','Documentation-ready coordination for qualified distribution conversations.','Hello {{contact_name}},\n\n{{brand_name}} supports distribution-focused peptide sourcing conversations with commercially clear follow-up and documentation-aware coordination.\n\nFor ingredient distributors, we keep the discussion focused on what helps a sourcing review move forward efficiently.\n\nWhat We Can Help With:\n- MOQ flexibility support where planning needs vary by opportunity\n- Documentation support for internal buyer and compliance review\n- Sourcing coordination and qualified B2B supply communication\n\nIf useful, we would be glad to learn what {{company_name}} is currently evaluating.\n\n{{default_signature}}','<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#243548;\">Hello {{contact_name}},</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#243548;\">{{brand_name}} supports distribution-focused peptide sourcing conversations with commercially clear follow-up and documentation-aware coordination.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#243548;\">For ingredient distributors, we keep the discussion focused on what helps a sourcing review move forward efficiently.</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 24px;background:#F7FAFD;border:1px solid #DCE6F2;border-radius:16px;\"><tr><td style=\"padding:20px 22px;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:18px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.2px;color:#0A1A2F;text-transform:uppercase;\">What We Can Help With</div><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\"><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"18\" style=\"padding:0 10px 12px 0;\"><div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:#2E6BFF;border-radius:50%;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div></td><td style=\"padding:0 0 12px;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#243548;\">MOQ flexibility support where planning needs vary by opportunity</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"18\" style=\"padding:0 10px 12px 0;\"><div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:#2E6BFF;border-radius:50%;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div></td><td style=\"padding:0 0 12px;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#243548;\">Documentation support for internal buyer and compliance review</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"18\" style=\"padding:0 10px 0 0;\"><div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:#2E6BFF;border-radius:50%;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div></td><td style=\"padding:0;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#243548;\">Sourcing coordination and qualified B2B supply communication</td></tr></table></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0 0 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#243548;\">If useful, we would be glad to learn what {{company_name}} is currently evaluating.</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 10px;\"><tr><td><a href=\"mailto:{{reply_to_email}}?subject={{brand_name}}%20Distribution%20Discussion\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#2E6BFF;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;line-height:15px;padding:14px 22px;border-radius:12px;\">Review Requirements</a></td></tr></table><div style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#5B6B7E;\">You can also reply with the categories, documentation needs, or sourcing priorities your team is reviewing.</div>','Hello {{contact_name}},\n\n{{brand_name}} supports distribution-focused peptide sourcing conversations with commercially clear follow-up and documentation-aware coordination.\n\nFor ingredient distributors, we keep the discussion focused on what helps a sourcing review move forward efficiently.\n\nWhat We Can Help With:\n- MOQ flexibility support where planning needs vary by opportunity\n- Documentation support for internal buyer and compliance review\n- Sourcing coordination and qualified B2B supply communication\n\nIf useful, we would be glad to learn what {{company_name}} is currently evaluating.\n\nReply to: {{reply_to_email}}\n\n{{default_signature}}',0,1,NOW(),NOW()),
(1,'Initial Outreach - Contract Manufacturers','Contract manufacturers','Supply coordination support for {{company_name}}','Structured sourcing support for manufacturing teams reviewing quantity, timing, and documentation.','Hello {{contact_name}},\n\nI am reaching out from {{brand_name}} because {{brand_name}} supports qualified manufacturing-side sourcing conversations with a practical commercial process.\n\nFor contract manufacturers, we focus on supply coordination that is clear, documentation-aware, and easy to move through internal review.\n\nTypical Support Areas:\n- MOQ flexibility support for program planning\n- Documentation support for technical and commercial stakeholders\n- Batch transparency and sourcing coordination for qualified opportunities\n\nIf useful, we would be glad to discuss what {{company_name}} is currently working through.\n\n{{default_signature}}','<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#243548;\">Hello {{contact_name}},</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#243548;\">I am reaching out from {{brand_name}} because {{brand_name}} supports qualified manufacturing-side sourcing conversations with a practical commercial process.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#243548;\">For contract manufacturers, we focus on supply coordination that is clear, documentation-aware, and easy to move through internal review.</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 24px;background:#F7FAFD;border:1px solid #DCE6F2;border-radius:16px;\"><tr><td style=\"padding:20px 22px;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:18px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.2px;color:#0A1A2F;text-transform:uppercase;\">Typical Support Areas</div><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\"><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"18\" style=\"padding:0 10px 12px 0;\"><div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:#2E6BFF;border-radius:50%;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div></td><td style=\"padding:0 0 12px;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#243548;\">MOQ flexibility support for program planning</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"18\" style=\"padding:0 10px 12px 0;\"><div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:#2E6BFF;border-radius:50%;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div></td><td style=\"padding:0 0 12px;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#243548;\">Documentation support for technical and commercial stakeholders</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"18\" style=\"padding:0 10px 0 0;\"><div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:#2E6BFF;border-radius:50%;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div></td><td style=\"padding:0;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#243548;\">Batch transparency and sourcing coordination for qualified opportunities</td></tr></table></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0 0 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#243548;\">If useful, we would be glad to discuss what {{company_name}} is currently working through.</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 10px;\"><tr><td><a href=\"mailto:{{reply_to_email}}?subject={{brand_name}}%20Manufacturing%20Support\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#2E6BFF;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;line-height:15px;padding:14px 22px;border-radius:12px;\">Discuss Sourcing Needs</a></td></tr></table><div style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#5B6B7E;\">Reply with your quantity range, timing window, or documentation priorities and we can take it from there.</div>','Hello {{contact_name}},\n\nI am reaching out from {{brand_name}} because {{brand_name}} supports qualified manufacturing-side sourcing conversations with a practical commercial process.\n\nFor contract manufacturers, we focus on supply coordination that is clear, documentation-aware, and easy to move through internal review.\n\nTypical Support Areas:\n- MOQ flexibility support for program planning\n- Documentation support for technical and commercial stakeholders\n- Batch transparency and sourcing coordination for qualified opportunities\n\nIf useful, we would be glad to discuss what {{company_name}} is currently working through.\n\nReply to: {{reply_to_email}}\n\n{{default_signature}}',0,1,NOW(),NOW()),
(1,'Initial Outreach - Research Supply Buyers','Research supply buyers','Professional sourcing support for {{company_name}}','Documentation-first support for qualified research supply sourcing conversations.','Hello {{contact_name}},\n\n{{brand_name}} supports qualified B2B research supply buyers with straightforward sourcing coordination and documentation-aware communication.\n\nOur goal is to keep the conversation useful, credible, and easy for internal review.\n\nWhy Teams Work With {{brand_name}}:\n- MOQ flexibility support when requirements vary by project stage\n- Documentation support for internal evaluation\n- Batch transparency and sourcing coordination with qualified B2B communication\n\nIf this is relevant for {{company_name}}, we would be glad to continue the conversation.\n\n{{default_signature}}','<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#243548;\">Hello {{contact_name}},</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#243548;\">{{brand_name}} supports qualified B2B research supply buyers with straightforward sourcing coordination and documentation-aware communication.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#243548;\">Our goal is to keep the conversation useful, credible, and easy for internal review.</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 24px;background:#F7FAFD;border:1px solid #DCE6F2;border-radius:16px;\"><tr><td style=\"padding:20px 22px;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:18px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.2px;color:#0A1A2F;text-transform:uppercase;\">Why Teams Work With {{brand_name}}</div><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\"><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"18\" style=\"padding:0 10px 12px 0;\"><div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:#2E6BFF;border-radius:50%;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div><