 Batch transparency and sourcing coordination with qualified B2B communication\n\nIf this is relevant for {{company_name}}, we would be glad to continue the conversation.\n\nReply to: {{reply_to_email}}\n\n{{default_signature}}',0,1,NOW(),NOW()),
(1,'Follow-Up 1','Other','Checking in on your sourcing review at {{company_name}}','A quick follow-up in case your team is still reviewing priorities.','Hello {{contact_name}},\n\nI wanted to follow up on my earlier note from {{brand_name}}.\n\nIf {{company_name}} is still reviewing peptide sourcing needs, we would be glad to continue the conversation in a concise, requirement-focused way.\n\nWhat We Can Help With:\n- MOQ flexibility support\n- Documentation support\n- Batch transparency and sourcing coordination\n\nIf useful, reply with the category or sourcing requirement your team is reviewing.\n\n{{default_signature}}','<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#243548;\">Hello {{contact_name}},</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#243548;\">I wanted to follow up on my earlier note from {{brand_name}}.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#243548;\">If {{company_name}} is still reviewing peptide sourcing needs, we would be glad to continue the conversation in a concise, requirement-focused way.</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 22px;background:#F7FAFD;border:1px solid #DCE6F2;border-radius:16px;\"><tr><td style=\"padding:18px 20px;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:18px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.2px;color:#0A1A2F;text-transform:uppercase;\">What We Can Help With</div><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\"><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"18\" style=\"padding:0 10px 12px 0;\"><div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:#2E6BFF;border-radius:50%;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div></td><td style=\"padding:0 0 12px;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#243548;\">MOQ flexibility support</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"18\" style=\"padding:0 10px 12px 0;\"><div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;ba